{"type":"assistant","uuid":"1961f55f-ae7a-4f5d-8e35-75142dad70e2","session_id":"15ac22d5-ebe7-4127-864a-afafa01a191e","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"id":"1961f55f-ae7a-4f5d-8e35-75142dad70e2","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'll start by analyzing the bug and locating the relevant code. The crash occurs in `Entry.java` during Base32 decoding when an invalid secret is entered. Let me explore the codebase.\n\n\n\n"}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}}}
